Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files 1970–73, DEF 12–5 INDIA. Secret;
                    Immediate; Exdis. Drafted by Schneider on November 30. Cleared by Van Hollen, Irwin, Haig, and
                    Pickering in PM, and in substance by Sisco and Colonel Gross in DOD/ISA. Approved by Secretary Rogers. Repeated to Islamabad.
